OpenBSD chroot and routing-domain sandbox for Nix 2.35.

Reuse the Unix build-user lifecycle and shared chroot output handling.
Require an explicitly reserved routing-domain pool for ordinary builds.
Fixed-output builds retain networking; unsupported modes fail closed.

